classDiagram
    %% Keep this file updated so it matches your final implementation.

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +int available_hours
        +list preferences
        +list pets
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +get_pets() list
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +str breed
        +int age
        +list tasks
        +add_task(task: Task) None
        +remove_task(task: Task) None
        +get_tasks() list
        +get_pending_tasks() list
    }

    class Task {
        +str name
        +str type
        +int duration
        +str priority
        +str preferred_time
        +str scheduled_time
        +str due_time
        +bool completed
        +mark_complete() None
        +is_overdue() bool
        +update(kwargs) None
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +Pet pet
        +int daily_time_budget
        +str start_time
        +list generated_plan
        +generate_plan() list
        +prioritize_tasks() list
        +assign_time_slots() None
        +display_plan() str
        +get_reasoning() str
    }

    Owner "1" --> "many" Pet : owns
    Pet "1" --> "many" Task : has
    Scheduler --> Owner : uses
    Scheduler --> Pet : schedules for
